---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Ethical & Sustainable ASM Mining"
  description="Our own artisanal and small-scale mining operations, run with responsible sourcing, environmental stewardship and community partnership."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/#what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Ethical &amp; Sustainable ASM Mining</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Our own operations are where our standards get tested first. We
        champion sustainable and ethical mining practices that respect both
        people and planet, guided by responsibility, transparency and a
        long-term view.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>Environmental stewardship</h2>
          <p>
            We employ methods designed to minimise ecological impact and
            regenerate mined landscapes: restoration, water protection and
            biodiversity preservation built into every project. We measure
            and report our footprint so it can actually be managed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>Community and women&rsquo;s participation</h2>
          <p>
            We work directly with local communities on shared growth:
            education, fair income and empowerment, with particular focus
            on women&rsquo;s participation in mining regions. Local leaders
            and families are involved at every step, building social
            systems that outlast any single project.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about our operations</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
